pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
elements:
  - elementId: p3-kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 34, 300, 20]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      text: "03 · 方法总览"
  - elementId: p3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 56, 864, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: KDS-EL：闭环知识引导的进化学习框架
  - elementId: p3-header-line
    elementType: line
    bounds: [48, 102, 864, 2]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0,0 1,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: p3-fig
    elementType: image
    bounds: [48, 118, 500, 360]
    src: "media/F1_framework.png"
    fit: {mode: contain}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: p3-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 492, 500, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "图 1 · KDS-EL 整体框架：MI 启动 → 特征重要性 W 更新 → KER 反哺 → TPS 部署"
  - elementId: p3-right-intro
    elementType: text
    bounds: [588, 112, 324, 76]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 11
      lineHeight: 1.35
      text: |
        <p>KDS-EL 以多任务 PSO（MEL）为优化骨架，用 <strong>N=20 个 0/1 粒子</strong>搜索特征子集；MI 先给起点，每轮把改进对应的特征得失写入 <strong>W</strong>。W 是特征重要性向量，记录每个特征对搜索改进的贡献；KER 按 W 精化精英，TPS 分阶段调整目标权重。</p>
  - elementId: p3-s1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [588, 190, 40, 28]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "01"
  - elementId: p3-s1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [636, 188, 276, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      text: 知识启动
  - elementId: p3-s1-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [636, 216, 276, 40]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 12
      text: 用 MI 筛出与标签相关的特征，给一半种群提供初始探索起点；搜索停滞时再用它恢复多样性。
  - elementId: p3-line1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [588, 262, 324, 1]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0,0 1,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: p3-s2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [588, 272, 40, 28]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "02"
  - elementId: p3-s2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [636, 270, 276, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      text: 知识更新
  - elementId: p3-s2-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [636, 298, 276, 40]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 12
      text: 每次改进都更新特征重要性向量 W：选中的特征加分、丢弃的减分；0.99 衰减让近期经验更重要。
  - elementId: p3-line2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [588, 344, 324, 1]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0,0 1,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: p3-s3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [588, 354, 40, 28]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "03"
  - elementId: p3-s3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [636, 352, 276, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      text: 知识反哺
  - elementId: p3-s3-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [636, 380, 276, 40]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 12
      text: KER 用特征重要性 W 给特征打分，只翻转最可能改善结果的特征位，让精英解越精化越好。
  - elementId: p3-line3
    elementType: line
    bounds: [588, 426, 324, 1]
    viewBox: [1, 1]
    points: "0,0 1,0"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: p3-s4-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [588, 436, 40, 28]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      bold: true
      color: "$accent"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: "04"
  - elementId: p3-s4-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [636, 434, 276, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      text: 知识部署
  - elementId: p3-s4-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [636, 462, 276, 40]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 12
      text: TPS 按阶段切换精度与特征数权重：前期快速压缩，后期精细调优。
  - elementId: p3-footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [890, 516, 40, 18]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      fontSize: 11
      align: [right, middle]
      text: "04"
